  "evidence": "TEXT_G: Maintain and modernise defence while only stepping down nuclear posture (end continuous patrols); qualified teachers in every class with Ofsted oversight and a Royal College of Teachers; replace PCCs with Police Boards and a victims’ bill; complete Universal Credit with back‑to‑work support and review sanctions; enforce the Minimum Wage and pay the Living Wage in central government; £8bn extra for the NHS and mental health parity. TEXT_C: Scrap Trident and oppose renewal; halt Universal Credit and PIP rollout, reverse DLA‑to‑PIP, overhaul sanctions, and raise UC work allowance; scrap the House of Lords and introduce STV for Commons; strong Scottish in‑group framing (\"make Scotland stronger,\" keep Tories out); increase NHS spending and mental health investment; keep 1,000 extra police and seek VAT exemption for Police and Fire.",
